# W9, host a (k10: Leomon's flag 20 opens the Fortress): hosts in stag0101 while b walks home through the Fortress.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
wander 460 170 15 until epoch>=@900
idle until frames>=60
